[{"title":"江上送吴子","author":"王廷陈","text":"垂老难为别，那堪落木纷。\n云霞缘岸合，凫鹜触船分。\n霜浦兰尊竭，风城玉笛闻。\n此生湖海上，何日再逢君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21672,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟夜","author":"王廷陈","text":"澄潭宜夕霁，倒岫入波流。\n宿桨依枫岸，张筵面橘洲。\n露萦鲛女泣，月泻翠娥游。\n窈窕群仙接，无烦海上求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21673,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过张道士方丈二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"欲寻方外侣，奈迫区中缘。\n石髓不可遇，山房聊借眠。\n虚空逃汉起，道德出关传。\n何日丹砂就，驱鸡上九天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21674,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过张道士方丈二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"洞壑邻鲛馆，烟霞绕凤台。\n神君当昼下，仙客御风来。\n瑶草侵阶长，桃花覆水开。\n愿言分玉醴，坐遣壮颜回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21675,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得陈鲁南书感而赋此","author":"王廷陈","text":"与子才非敌，于予意颇亲。\n归来各吴楚，老去竟参辰。\n忽枉兼金讯，长怀如玉人。\n此生重见否，数过益伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21676,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄颜惟乔五首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"马卿才岂劣，狗监荐难逢。\n近老时名损，长贫世事慵。\n昂藏身是鹤，变化德犹龙。\n道大如君者，斯人宜不容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21677,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄颜惟乔五首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"闻子幽栖处，绝无人世喧。\n琴书元栗里，鸡犬似桃源。\n云影昼垂席，溪流春到门。\n弓旌早晚至，白首去丘园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21678,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄颜惟乔五首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"身弃名何赖，才高世总违。\n著书唯木榻，远害独荷衣。\n游夏辞难赞，渔樵迹近微。\n时能共童冠，溪上咏而归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21679,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄颜惟乔五首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"道困已如此，年衰将奈何。\n有时传郢曲，落日更商歌。\n长夜真难旦，阳春未拟和。\n秪应具舟楫，乘兴数相过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21680,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄颜惟乔五首 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"昔君为亳守，谈笑靖风尘。\n郡已歼豺虎，时翻忌凤麟。\n奇功元不赏，直节竟无邻。\n后代看今史，方知社稷臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21681,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠邻叟","author":"王廷陈","text":"屈曲溪回谷，青苍树隐村。\n深山无甲子，老境有儿孙。\n畏吏栖乡井，逢人问国门。\n渔舟花下入，还似武陵源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21682,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访友人","author":"王廷陈","text":"同是栖岩者，今为出谷求。\n攀嵇遥命驾，访戴不回舟。\n丽日青芜郭，香风白芷洲。\n亲交近零落，愿子晚绸缪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21683,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祖茔前溪边穫稻","author":"王廷陈","text":"迹缘桑梓重，心厌稻粱谋。\n祖德何能述，农功此暂留。\n黄云殷陇亩，白鹤唳汀洲。\n正苦苍山暮，那堪碧树秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21684,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭江景孚二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"昔献金门赋，曾追玉署游。\n碧山怜息马，丹壑叹藏舟。\n壮志风云散，遗书馆阁收。\n延陵徒把剑，何日挂松楸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21685,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭江景孚二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"子已先朝露，文章失凤毛。\n人皆惜年少，天亦厌才高。\n学草馀池墨，流芳托楚骚。\n因之念朋侣，寥落半蓬蒿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21686,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过倪道士故居二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"服食知非误，先期汗漫游。\n閒门山鬼啸，何处谷神留。\n丹诀乾坤袐，玄文海岳收。\n谁知松子宅，亦有世人忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21687,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过倪道士故居二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"寂寞云君箓，摧残凤女台。\n海田犹有变，洞壑岂无哀。\n始学乘牛去，终期化鹤来。\n室馀金灶火，千古不成灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21688,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜张子自滇至","author":"王廷陈","text":"故渚依黄鹤，长途自碧鸡。\n瑶华归有赠，宝剑去曾携。\n骥足衰难展，羊肠险遍跻。\n从今无复出，溪上伴凫鹥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21689,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"老夫谙稼穑，次第葺园庐。\n对酒唯田父，呼门绝里胥。\n桑麻经雨后，花竹宛秦馀。\n如此生涯足，何劳荐子虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21690,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"事去心逾壮，年来迹转孤。\n濯缨临汉沔，安枕荷黄虞。\n春涧偏鱼鸟，秋窗近竹梧。\n出逢邻叟饮，醉倩野童扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21691,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"避人开石户，览物坐山堂。\n湘柚寒增色，江蓠晚更香。\n卜居悲楚客，招隐忆淮王。\n寂寞吾甘守，浮沉念总忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21692,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"计拙堪时弃，谋生托野人。\n莺花无约束，木石有比邻。\n溪上思龙蛰，林间学鸟伸。\n逢人无一面，语契即情亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21693,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"天地一虚舟，浮沉双白鸥。\n半生从失计，万事不关愁。\n山月杯中映，江云几上流。\n狂歌人莫测，吾兴属沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21694,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其六","author":"王廷陈","text":"圃坐晴逾丽，畦行晚更宜。\n客从萝径入，自笑葛巾攲。\n果熟山禽恋，林驯野鹿随。\n凭栏契物理，卫足颇钦葵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21695,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其七","author":"王廷陈","text":"树古村墟僻，江寒邑里秋。\n过云频送目，累月不梳头。\n废礼缘多病，求仁未寡尤。\n呼儿问网罟，明发上渔舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21696,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其八","author":"王廷陈","text":"叶减山争出，林秋景故偏。\n候虫喧冷砌，过雁影晴川。\n月酌沾松露，风吟杂涧泉。\n何人会幽兴，寂寂自鸣弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21697,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其九","author":"王廷陈","text":"物换竟谁使，朋来非我期。\n曙光随日薄，秋籁入云悲。\n速妇开新酝，从儿诵古诗。\n自为真率饮，忘却鬓成丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21698,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄杂兴十首 其十","author":"王廷陈","text":"萝轩时散帙，苔涧亦垂纶。\n翠竹供诗遍，苍林佐酒频。\n岫重迟见旭，源曲易迷津。\n早契沈冥理，难为俗子陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21699,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋日陪七泽兄饮","author":"王廷陈","text":"行年嗟近老，流序忽惊秋。\n虽奉连枝喜，其如一叶愁。\n孤烟沉邑井，返照入林丘。\n少日青云志，相看耻未酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21700,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人","author":"王廷陈","text":"君移夏口棹，去作越中游。\n腊意含新柳，春声隐冻流。\n南行探禹穴，东望接蓬丘。\n湖上风光好，莺花累月留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21701,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日同田子宴武昌西山","author":"王廷陈","text":"令节樊山宴，深秋楚客哀。\n云长一雁往，江远片帆来。\n倦倚丹枫憩，回看苍渚开。\n登高复能赋，知尔大夫才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21702,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日寄刘子","author":"王廷陈","text":"直道古来少，如公迥不群。\n结庐衡岳下，垂钓古江濆。\n竹向皇英觅，云从赤帝分。\n惭予亦楚产，何可拟清芬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21703,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归自山庄作","author":"王廷陈","text":"万事形骸外，半生鱼鸟间。\n为农稀出郭，习隐不居山。\n晴旭欢独往，暮云倦与还。\n呼儿检赋草，闭户细加删。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21704,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊园","author":"王廷陈","text":"独此郊园寂，兼之徒侣稀。\n灌园踏碧草，把酒看翠微。\n竹晚轻飔度，楼晴片月依。\n自无致身策，莫遣赏心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21705,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张都阃致仕归二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"山郭秋阴重，江流画戟明。\n亦知南顾虑，其奈北堂情。\n去偃龙蛇阵，归寻猿鹤盟。\n伏波今未老，铜柱尚标名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21706,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张都阃致仕归二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"尔家淮海曲，秋日赋归来。\n戎服本儒行，将军今老莱。\n旧谙司马法，兼有季鹰才。\n宝剑君长拭，无令染绿苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21707,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿九峰寺","author":"王廷陈","text":"疋马九峰下，寒宵万壑阴。\n月当层殿起，云拥曲廊深。\n煮茗开松阁，焚香对石林。\n诸天倚愁寂，钟磬净尘心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21708,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭陈鲁南二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"九原如可作，诸子孰能俦。\n只字都人重，遗书汉使求。\n龙蛇贤运厄，霄汉岁星收。\n检尔平生赠，长吟恨未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21709,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭陈鲁南二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"尚忆论经地，犹闻考牧年。\n焚鱼沧海上，吊鹤白云边。\n竟阻生刍奠，遥悲宿草阡。\n从兹广陵散，无复世人传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21710,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以诗赋呈诸知己","author":"王廷陈","text":"形秽燕人石，心怜楚客词。\n自矜小子学，直愧壮夫为。\n积岁知多误，成家恨已迟。\n抱琴者谁子，弦绝为钟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21711,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有自郢来者辄有所述敬赋三诗 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"帝典隆先德，王心永孝思。\n一为沛邑幸，重睹汉官仪。\n民以枌榆复，恩于父老私。\n普天蒙在宥，兹地特先施。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21712,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有自郢来者辄有所述敬赋三诗 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"周王湛露雅，汉帝大风歌。\n野老提携听，邦人感激哦。\n邑争牛酒献，道望羽旄过。\n金石音当被，乾坤德岂磨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21713,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有自郢来者辄有所述敬赋三诗 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"殿阁重临日，园陵历览馀。\n闾阎闻警跸，妇子识銮舆。\n谷应轩辕律，山藏大禹书。\n天文将睿藻，辉焕楚村墟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21714,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴魏子园亭二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"池馆名江国，宾朋实楚材。\n屏间烟雾湿，镜里芰荷开。\n鹤以吹笙下，鱼因鼓瑟来。\n尽欢须秉烛，歌妓莫频催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21715,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴魏子园亭二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"近市林依宅，丛生桂插天。\n偶来大隐地，高咏小山篇。\n萝暝云归洞，篁疏月到筵。\n花间迷出处，须仗主人前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21716,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过魏园兼观众作辄赋二首用前韵 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"投李惭无报，如樗分不材。\n草堂缘主重，竹径为谁开。\n偶与观鱼坐，频能相鸟来。\n高城虽日暮，归骑且停催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21717,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过魏园兼观众作辄赋二首用前韵 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"卜筑虽人境，无喧即洞天。\n买园便水竹，留客出诗篇。\n砌鹤晴随仗，城云晚驻筵。\n苦吟何不就，珠玉烂吾前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21718,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集魏园再用前韵二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"名园邀上客，一一豫章材。\n盖转苍林入，尊当锦石开。\n跳波鱼自乐，得食鸟频来。\n莫厌相过数，星霜暗已催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21719,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集魏园再用前韵二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"秋至犹啼鸟，林丘别有天。\n客皆中散驾，诗是少陵篇。\n翠筱留吟管，丹霞冒酒筵。\n平生山水调，今日尽君前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21720,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戴子","author":"王廷陈","text":"戴子自奇士，鸣鞭入我园。\n高义胆可吐，悲歌声复吞。\n羞称三辅侠，不食四君门。\n拔剑从此去，捐躯行报恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21721,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"王廷陈","text":"幽客晚窥户，农人秋筑场。\n牛羊归委巷，鹄鹜下回塘。\n寒潦蚀丛竹，凄风疏古杨。\n田园谁谓乐，牢落亦多伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21722,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圃内","author":"王廷陈","text":"力疾扶筇出，乘閒采药行。\n春林群鸟悦，朝日百花明。\n水石留连坐，亭台次第营。\n赏心犹未巳，极浦暮云生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21723,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮汪氏庄","author":"王廷陈","text":"芜秽贫家产，悲伤过客魂。\n野翁谈废坞，邻竖入颓垣。\n石鼎烧松叶，瓷罂藉竹根。\n那堪对摇落，寒日下孤村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21724,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家僮举网获龟即命放之池中感而赋此","author":"王廷陈","text":"知与天机恊，形为世网婴。\n纵归纾汝困，求报岂吾情。\n幸不刳肠死，无妨曳尾生。\n微躯难自料，何贵有灵名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21725,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴道士山房四首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"日月神能驻，云雷气可生。\n石床苍藓剥，金涧紫芝荣。\n仗剑龙争役，吹笙鹤自迎。\n谁知列仙囿，今已在江城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21726,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴道士山房四首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"塞兑人难语，同尘市可藏。\n步虚朝振佩，礼斗夜焚香。\n林长金光草，峰开紫翠房。\n羞称小山侣，结束事淮王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21727,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴道士山房四首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"石髓邀宾饮，丹书闭户编。\n凤箫仙子下，鸿宝至人传。\n灭火遥挥雨，排空或驾烟。\n遨游凡几日，碧海欲成田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21728,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴道士山房四首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"逍遥潜咫尺，变化属须臾。\n朱雀来窥冶，苍龙为守炉。\n琼瑶林际草，山海壁间图。\n但使黄金就，宁悲白日徂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21729,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁生马射","author":"王廷陈","text":"生本五陵儿，骁雄主将知。\n弓弯明月抱，马过浮云驰。\n观者咸称善，敌人何敢窥。\n时平罢征戍，应不困边陲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21730,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张子鱼二首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"张衡吾畏友，今已赋归田。\n谗口虽三至，嘉名每独全。\n剑分终自合，宝弃复谁怜。\n道远无由晤，含悽寄此篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21731,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张子鱼二首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"肮脏时多忌，逢迎术转疏。\n一朝怀薜荔，即日弃簪裾。\n把翰思玄赋，投鱼隐素书。\n试看当路子，驰骛竟何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21732,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊汪子","author":"王廷陈","text":"兰芳元自祸，玉玷竟谁磨。\n逝水今如此，为山复几何。\n案馀萤照息，谷更鸟声多。\n且未游方外，临尸讵忍歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21733,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪泛咏水中月影","author":"王廷陈","text":"圆景悬初满，澄川映颇宜。\n鱼龙蟾并窟，荷芰桂联枝。\n击汰珠光碎，沿流璧彩随。\n素娥非不洁，终夕浴涟漪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21734,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日学宫见雪","author":"王廷陈","text":"雪是初春积，人于此地逢。\n纡回青帝驾，散漫素王宫。\n向晦能无昧，当阳忽已融。\n映书贫士喜，何计缓东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21735,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初月","author":"王廷陈","text":"举头新月上，宴坐北堂时。\n入揽不盈手，窥妆秪肖眉。\n蓂生桂与逐，蚌实兔偏随。\n清光勿恨少，向满每由兹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21736,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书馆对雪示诸子","author":"王廷陈","text":"白屋初鸣霰，青衿此下帷。\n欢披谢客赋，苦咏曹人诗。\n莫逐轻盈性，须安寒素姿。\n林中有杞梓，今尽化琼枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21737,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游赠刘子","author":"王廷陈","text":"时禽犹啸匹，欢赏合携俦。\n未老县车卧，乘春结驷游。\n云光驰翠巘，树彩幕芳洲。\n饮兴无令尽，明朝复此求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21738,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中得颜子书并见示诸作一首","author":"王廷陈","text":"卧病当寒景，空斋正尔思。\n五禽终日戏，双鲤远方贻。\n久著潜夫论，初传少女碑。\n君才犹不用，如我复何悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21739,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道院对雪","author":"王廷陈","text":"朔雪兼风度，玄宫此日开。\n飘飖万鹤集，髣髴五神来。\n缀洞石垂乳，被岩瑶作台。\n晚筵闻凤吹，益信在蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21740,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"王廷陈","text":"并介元殊性，浮湛非一欢。\n啸歌聊自适，侪类肯相宽。\n努力时难值，惊心岁易阑。\n何能忘魏阙，自分老江干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21741,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]